	(text "4 MHz OSCILLATOR / 2, OR AN EXTERNAL CLOCK; THE DEBUG HEADER" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3aa5fd4a-3de1-57cc-8870-21c6fc1c4ea6"))
	(text "X1 4 MHz; U4A divides it by 2: CLK_INT 2 MHz. JP1 picks INT or EXT for the 1802's CLOCK. EXT_CLK comes in on J2\n(a jumper wire from a debug board), held low by R2, through a Schmitt inverter (U7A). J2 also brings out CLOCK,\nSC0 and SC1; U9D/U9E buffer SC0 onto the bus (position 36): low = an instruction fetch." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e50682f4-5bc8-5ae2-98ee-627f806292be"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
